.TP
.B Domain Conflict
Multiple agents claiming same domain authority

.TP
.B Agent Not Found
Reference to non-existent agent, check agent creation

.SH SECURITY
Grimoire implements several security features:

.TP
.B True Name Authentication
Cryptographic entity identification using SHA256 hashes

.TP
.B Domain Authority
Hierarchical permission system preventing unauthorized actions

.TP
.B Immutable Pacts
Contracts that cannot be modified after creation

.TP
.B Sandboxed Execution
Familiars operate within controlled environments

.SH PERFORMANCE
Tips for optimal performance:

.TP
.B Agent Hierarchy
Balance the number of agents per level to avoid overhead

.TP
.B Reporting
Limit activity reporting to necessary categories

.TP
.B Pact Efficiency
Design pacts with clear, specific terms

.TP
.B Resource Management
Monitor resource allocation through archons

